"00:46.870">to </span><span begin="00:46.870" end="00:47.333">be </span><span begin="00:47.333" end="00:48.062">more </span><span begin="00:48.062" end="00:49.366">honest</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.573" end="00:55.604"><span begin="00:50.573" end="00:50.806">And </span><span begin="00:50.806" end="00:51.294">I </span><span begin="00:51.294" end="00:51.870">must </span><span begin="00:51.870" end="00:52.445">admit </span><span begin="00:52.445" end="00:52.717">you've </span><span begin="00:52.717" end="00:53.356">been </span><span begin="00:53.356" end="00:53.659">in </span><span begin="00:53.659" end="00:54.324">quite </span><span begin="00:54.324" end="00:54.836">a </span><span begin="00:54.836" end="00:55.604">few</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.892" end="01:02.285"><span begin="00:57.892" end="01:01.276">Halley's </span><span begin="01:01.276" end="01:02.285">Comet</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.748" end="01:09.380"><span begin="01:03.748" end="01:04.507">Comes </span><span begin="01:04.507" end="01:05.316">around </span><span begin="01:05.524" end="01:06.443">more </span><span begin="01:07.461" end="01:07.651">than </span><span begin="01:07.651" end="01:08.524">I </span><span begin="01:08.524" end="01:09.380">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.915" end="01:17.339"><span begin="01:10.915" end="01:11.166">But </span><span begin="01:11.166" end="01:11.613">you're </span><span begin="01:11.613" end="01:12.155">all </span><span begin="01:12.155" end="01:12.365">it </span><span begin="01:12.365" end="01:12.771">takes </span><span begin="01:12.771" end="01:13.187">for </span><span begin="01:13.187" end="01:13.780">me </span><span begin="01:13.780" end="01:13.996">to </span><span begin="01:13.996" end="01:14.539">break </span><span begin="01:14.539" end="01:14.859">a </span><span begin="01:14.859" end="01:17.339">promise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.385" end="01:22.665"><span begin="01:18.385" end="01:19.106">Silly </span><span begin="01:19.106" end="01:19.664">me </span><span begin="01:19.664" end="01:19.937">to </span><span begin="01:19.937" end="01:20.378">fall </span><span begin="01:20.378" end="01:20.747">in </span><span begin="01:20.747" end="01:21.641">love </span><span begin="01:21.641" end="01:21.937">with </span><span begin="01:21.937" end="01:22.665">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.488" end="01:27.521"><span begin="01:24.488" end="01:24.977">I </span><span begin="01:24.977" end="01:25.664">haven't </span><span begin="01:25.664" end="01:26.136">slept </span><span begin="01:26.136" end="01:26.544">since </span><span begin="01:26.544" end="01:27.521">Sunday</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.816" end="01:37.514"><span begin="01:27.816" end="01:28.689">Midnight </span><span begin="01:28.689" end="01:29.112">for </span><span begin="01:29.112" end="01:29.488">me </span><span begin="01:29.488" end="01:29.897">is </span><span begin="01:29.897" end="01:30.297">3</span><span begin="01:30.297" end="01:33.609">AM </span><span begin="01:34.605" end="01:35.113">for </span><span begin="01:35.113" end="01:37.514">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.904" end="01:41.064"><span begin="01:37.904" end="01:38.049">But </span><span begin="01:38.049" end="01:38.360">my </span><span begin="01:38.360" end="01:39.144">sleepless </span><span begin="01:39.144" end="01:39.560">nights </span><span begin="01:39.560" end="01:40.041">are </span><span begin="01:40.041" end="01:41.064">better</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.328" end="01:51.185"><span begin="01:41.328" end="01:41.728">With </span><span begin="01:41.728" end="01:42.081">you </span><span begin="01:42.081" end="01:42.464">than </span><span begin="01:42.464" end="01:42.961">nights </span><span begin="01:42.961" end="01:43.408">could </span><span begin="01:43.408" end="01:44.424">ever </span><span begin="01:44.672" end="01:45.417">be </span><span begin="01:45.616" end="01:47.512">alone </span><span begin="01:48.177" end="01:49.968">ooh </span><span begin="01:49.968" end="01:50.232">ooh-</span><span begin="01:50.232" end="01:50.384">ooh </span><span begin="01:50.384" end="01:51.185">ooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.392" end="01:56.953"><span begin="01:51.392" end="01:51.632">I </span><span begin="01:51.632" end="01:51.951">was </span><span begin="01:51.951" end="01:52.497">good </span><span begin="01:52.497" end="01:52.852">at </span><span begin="01:52.852" end="01:53.663">feeling </span><span begin="01:53.663" end="01:54.344">nothin' </span><span begin="01:54.344" end="01:54.841">now </span><span begin="01:54.841" end="01:55.400">I'm </span><span begin="01:55.400" end="01:56.953">hopeless</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.696" end="02:09.344"><span begin="01:58.696" end="01:59.304">What </span><span begin="01:59.304" end="01:59.512">a </span><span begin="01:59.512" end="02:00.080">drag </span><span begin="02:00.080" end="02:00.743">to </span><span begin="02:00.743" end="02:01.105">love </span><span begin="02:01.105" end="02:01.504">you </span><span begin="02:01.504" end="02:02.103">like </span><span begin="02:02.103" end="02:02.872">I </span><span begin="02:02.872" end="02:05.167">do </span><span begin="02:05.167" end="02:05.471">ooh-</span><span begin="02:05.471" end="02:06.672">ooh </span><span begin="02:06.672" end="02:07.184">ooh </span><span begin="02:07.184" end="02:07.400">ooh </span><span begin="02:07.400" end="02:08.552">ooh </span><span begin="02:08.552" end="02:09.344">ooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.856" end="02:16.608"><span begin="02:11.856" end="02:12.664">Ooh-</span><span begin="02:12.664" end="02:13.608">ooh-</span><span begin="02:13.608" end="02:13.920">ooh </span><span begin="02:13.920" end="02:14.680">ooh </span><span begin="02:14.680" end="02:14.893">ooh-</span><span begin="02:14.893" end="02:15.208">ooh </span><span begin="02:15.208" end="02:15.592">ooh-</span><span begin="02:15.592" end="02:16.608">ooh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.169" end="02:23.317"><span begin="02:18.169" end="02:18.496">I've </span><span begin="02:18.496" end="02:18.944">been </span><span begin="02:18.944" end="02:19.402">loved </span><span begin="02:19.754" end="02:20.426">before </span><span begin="02:20.426" end="02:20.721">but </span><span begin="02:20.721" end="02:21.161">right </span><span begin="02:21.161" end="02:21.629">now </span><span begin="02:21.845" end="02:22.054">in </span><span begin="02:22.054" end="02:22.437">this </span><span begin="02:22.437" end="02:23.317">moment</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.277" end="02:30.021"><span begin="02:25.277" end="02:25.493">I </span><span begin="02:25.493" end="02:25.861">feel </span><span begin="02:25.861" end="02:26.405">more </span><span begin="02:26.405" end="02:26.693">and </span><span begin="02:26.693" end="02:27.206">more </span><span begin="02:27.206" end="02:27.565">like </span><span begin="02:27.565" end="02:27.989">I </span><span begin="02:27.989" end="02:28.366">was </span><span begin="02:28.366" end="02:28.917">made </span><span begin="02:28.917" end="02:29.357">for </span><span begin="02:29.357" end="02:30.021">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:35.635" end="02:36.851"><span begin="02:35.635" end="02:36.060">For </span><span begin="02:36.060" end="02:36.851">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:02.612" end="03:08.409"><span begin="03:02.612" end="03:02.876">I'm </span><span begin="03:02.876" end="03:05.208">sitting </span><span begin="03:05.208" end="03:06.416">in </span><span begin="03:06.416" end="03:06.624">my </span><span begin="03:06.624" end="03:07.520">brother's </span><span begin="03:07.520" end="03:08.409">room</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.647" end="03:19.304"><span begin="03:12.647" end="03:12.984">Haven't </span><span begin="03:12.984" end="03:13.512">slept </span><span begin="03:13.809" end="03:13.993">in </span><span begin="03:13.993" end="03:14.136">a </span><span begin="03:14.136" end="03:14.744">week </span><span begin="03:16.024" end="03:16.375">or </span><span begin="03:16.375" end="03:17.192">two </span><span begin="03:18.314" end="03:18.664">or </span><span begin="03:18.664" end="03:19.304">two</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:20.489" end="03:28.128"><span begin="03:20.489" end="03:20.864">I </span><span begin="03:20.864" end="03:22.495">think </span><span begin="03:22.495" end="03:23.192">I </span><span begin="03:23.192" end="03:23.929">might </span><span begin="03:24.095" end="03:24.311">have </span><span begin="03:24.311" end="03:24.921">fallen </span><span begin="03:24.921" end="03:25.320">in </span><span begin="03:25.320" end="03:28.128">love</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.928" end="03:36.311"><span begin="03:29.928" end="03:31.816">What </span><span begin="03:31.816" end="03:32.113">am </span><span begin="03:32.113" end="03:33.983">I </span><span begin="03:33.983" end="03:34.392">to </span><span begin="03:34.392" end="03:36.311">do</span></p></div></body></tt>